msgid ""
"The bot finds a guard (in sight, where one was seen before, or in the nearest town), switches the PK mode to all mode, hits the guard once and lets it kill the character: no potions, no heals, no fighting back. It respawns in the city and goes again until the next level needs at least that much experience. The pet is put away first, and the PK mode is put back at the end. Deaths wear your gear like any death; a black-name character (Morality -1000 or lower) can lose worn gear when it dies, so the XP loser won't run for one."
msgstr ""
"Bot ek guard dhoondta hai (nazar mein, jahan pehle dekha gaya, ya qareebi shehar mein), PK mode all mode par karta hai, guard ko ek baar maarta hai aur character ko marne deta hai: na potion, na heal, na jawabi larai. Woh shehar mein dobara zinda hota hai aur tab tak dobara jata hai jab tak agle level ko kam az kam itni experience na chahiye. Pehle pet wapas rakha jata hai, aur aakhir mein PK mode wapas lagaya jata hai. Har maut ki tarah gear ghista hai; black-name character (Morality -1000 ya kam) marne par pehna hua gear kho sakta hai, is liye XP loser us ke liye nahi chalega."

